{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "decisions",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "1",
      "text": "已确认的架构决策\n\nD1 两级 ASC：每角色 Pawn 一个 + PlayerState 队伍级一个\nD2 每个玩家各带一支队伍（4 人房 × 3 角色 = 12 个角色 ASC）\nD3 废弃自研 Pipeline，移动回归 CharacterMovementComponent\nD4 同优先级 GA 由后来者打断先激活者（比较用 >）",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "3",
      "text": "[UE 输入框架]\n物理按键 → UInputAction → InputMappingContext\n\n入口：Enhanced Input\n作用：产生原始输入事件，本身与 GAS 无关",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "native-input",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "[照抄 Lyra]\n文件：Input/GGYGOInputComponent\n函数：BindNativeAction\n作用：Move / Look 直连回调，不进 GAS\n\n对照：LyraHeroComponent.cpp:285-289",
      "x": -450,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "ability-input",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "[照抄 Lyra]\n文件：Input/GGYGOInputConfig + GGYGOInputComponent\n函数：BindAbilityActions\n作用：动作类按键 → FGameplayTag(InputTag.*)\n\n对照：LyraHeroComponent.cpp:283",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "cmc",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "5",
      "text": "[D3 重建 · 移动权威]\n文件：Movement/Components/\n           GGYGOCharacterMovementComponent\n承载：步态权威（原 GaitAuthorityProcessor）\n           TurnBack 阶段机（原 TurnBackPhaseProcessor）\n           SavedMove 预测扩展、状态复制\n作用：AddMovementInput 的唯一落点，负责复制与纠正",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 250
    },
    {
      "id": "intent",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "5",
      "text": "[GGYGO 自建 · Lyra 无]\n文件：Pipeline/Intents/ActionIntentResolver\n           + InputBufferQueue + InputContextProbe\n输出：FGGYGOActionIntent + AbilityInputTag\n作用：长按/连按/方向/输入缓冲 → 语义意图\n\n只解释不执行；上下文从 CMC 与 ASC 只读采集",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 230
    },
    {
      "id": "rootmotion",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "5",
      "text": "[D3 重建 · 位移来源]\nZZZ 曲线 RM_PosX / RM_PosY / RM_Yaw\n\n路径 a（主体）：离线烘焙成 UE 原生 RootMotion\n路径 b（特例）：运行时构造 FRootMotionSource\n\n取代原 MotionDriver 直接写 Actor 位置的做法",
      "x": -500,
      "y": 830,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "arbitration",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "5",
      "text": "[GGYGO 扩展 Lyra]\n文件：AbilitySystem/GGYGOAbilitySystemComponent\n数据：ActiveAbilitiesByGroup + GroupConfig DataAsset\n作用：GroupTag + Priority + SelfPolicy 三维仲裁\n\nD4：比较用 > ，同级后来者胜出\n取代 Lyra 的 ActivationGroupCounts[3]",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 230
    },
    {
      "id": "asc",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "[GAS 原生 + Lyra 照抄]\n文件：AbilitySystem/GGYGOAbilitySystemComponent\n函数：AbilityInputTagPressed → ProcessAbilityInput\n           → TryActivateAbility\n作用：状态变更的唯一入口，承载预测 Key",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 1110,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "owner-avatar",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "[D1 已定 · 两级 ASC]\n角色 Pawn：ASC + HealthSet/CombatSet\n     Owner = Avatar = 自己，独立 HP/CD/Buff\n     参考 ALyraCharacterWithAbilities\n\nPlayerState：队伍 ASC + TeamAttributeSet\n     切人能量、连携值、切人技与队伍 Buff",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "ga",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "[Lyra 照抄 + 扩展]\n文件：AbilitySystem/Abilities/GGYGOGameplayAbility\n新增：GroupTag / Priority / SelfPolicy\n保留：ActivationPolicy / AdditionalCosts / 失败反馈",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 190
    },
    {
      "id": "ge",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "[GAS 原生 + Lyra 照抄]\n文件：AbilitySystem/Executions/GGYGODamageExecution\n机制：元属性 Damage → PostGameplayEffectExecute 转扣血\n作用：伤害、硬直、削韧、冷却、无敌帧",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 190
    },
    {
      "id": "montage",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "5",
      "text": "[表现通道 A]\n文件：AbilitySystem/Tasks/\n           AbilityTask_PlayMontageAndWaitForEvent\n作用：播动作本体，同时等 AnimNotify 事件\n\nLyra 没有此 Task，需从 GAS 官方示例移植",
      "x": -400,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "cue",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "4",
      "text": "[表现通道 B · GAS 原生]\n文件：AbilitySystem/Cues/GGYGOGameplayCueManager\n机制：GameplayCue.* Tag → Burst / Looping Notify\n作用：特效、音效、震屏、命中反馈",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "anim",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "2",
      "text": "[表现通道 C · 现有代码改造]\n文件：Animation/zzzAnim/ZZZAnimInstance\n改造：PipelineDrive 推送 → NativeUpdateAnimation 自拉\n数据源：CMC 的 Velocity/MovementMode/步态/TurnBack\n              + ASC 的 State.* / Restriction.* Tag\n\n快照结构与 Locomotion 决策算法保留；只读，不反写",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 1660,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "retired",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "1",
      "text": "D3 退役清单（约 25 个文件）\n\nPipeline/ 全部（ControlPipeline、ArbiterPipeline、\n     IntentPipeline、4 个 Arbiter、Interfaces、\n     Locomotion/View/MovementParameter Processor）\nDrivers/MotionDriver\nStateMachine/ 整套（StateManager、Idle/Moving State）\nComponents/GGYGOCharacterRuntimeComponent\nContracts/Pipeline、Contracts/State\nData/Runtime 的 Arbiter/State/Movement/Intent/View Model\n\n连带取消：ABaseCharacter::Tick 唯一帧调度入口",
      "x": -1150,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 340
    }
  ],
